         <div type="bio">
            <p>Parisian journalist. Active in the 1910s and 1920s, Ciolkowska contributed to <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">The Egoist</name>, where her columns entitled “Passing Paris” and “Fighting Paris” appeared in most issues. In 1915 she unsuccessfully attempted to find a publisher in Paris for <name type="work" key="W_APORTRAIT">A Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man</name>. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
